  "rnn-intro": ["Recurrent Neural Networks", "Networks with a hidden state that carries information across a sequence.", "Like reading a sentence while remembering the earlier words.", "S.H.T.V = Sequence, Hidden state, Time steps, Vanishing gradients", "h_t = tanh(W_x x_t + W_h h_{t-1} + b)", "What is the classic weakness of vanilla RNNs?", "Vanishing gradients over long sequences", "They cannot handle sequences", "They need images"],
