  "ethics-in-ai": ["AI Ethics", "Ensuring AI is fair, transparent, accountable, private and contestable.", "Like professional standards for doctors, applied to algorithms.", "F.A.T.P = Fairness, Accountability, Transparency, Privacy", "Publish a model card: intended use, limits, evaluation by subgroup, known risks.", "What is a model card?", "Documentation of a model's purpose, limits and evaluation", "A hardware component", "A pricing plan"],
