  "cv-intro": ["Computer Vision", "Extracting meaning from images and video: classification, detection and segmentation.", "Like giving a computer working eyesight.", "C.D.S.T = Classify, Detect, Segment, Track", "Classification: what is it?\nDetection: where is it?\nSegmentation: which pixels?", "What does object detection add over classification?", "Location of each object via bounding boxes", "Higher resolution images", "Faster training"],
